**Accepted (theory-solid, stop researching):** Herschel-Bulkley as constitutive law; yield-stress fields as the universal lock/permission mechanism; thixotropy as the ooze/settle mechanism; the continuum-over-boxes thesis; the energy function above; solid inclusions for content protection; shear-thickening-vs-fast-input as error prevention.

